1
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:12,080
=Fatal Proximity to Him=

2
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:14,120
=Episode 18=

3
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:18,360
Jinghang.

4
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:23,120
Where's Xiyu?

5
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:25,280
Didn't she come down ages ago?

6
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:26,360
You didn't see her?

7
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:28,680
Weren't you two coming together?

8
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:30,800
I took longer packing up,

9
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,160
so she said she'd head down first.

10
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:36,280
I'll go look for her.

11
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:39,080
Wait for me.

12
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:55,280
Isn't that Xiyu's bag?

13
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:58,320
Where's Xiyu?

14
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,480
I bet you're wondering

15
00:01:08,880 --> 00:01:10,320
where Luo Xiyu is right now.

16
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:12,040
I'll send you the location.

17
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:14,040
If you dare call the police,

18
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:16,560
I will kill Luo Xiyu.

19
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:29,760
Hey.

20
00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:31,920
You've got guts.

21
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:33,360
I'll give you that.

22
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,480
Going all by yourself

23
00:01:35,480 --> 00:01:36,840
to meet that loan shark?

24
00:01:37,440 --> 00:01:38,600
Li Junsheng, you douchebag!

25
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:40,120
He Lan won't let you get away with this!

26
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:52,840
Relax.

27
00:01:53,600 --> 00:01:54,360
In a little while,

28
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:56,000
I'll kill both of you together.

29
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:02,560
You asked me to track down Li Junsheng.

30
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:03,880
I found something.

31
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:07,560
Apparently, he's been looking into

32
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:08,880
a pharmaceutical businessman
who came back home from the U.S.

33
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:11,160
I've already sent

34
00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:12,560
the details to your WeChat.

35
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:12,960
Okay.

36
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:13,640
Thanks, Mr. Chen.

37
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:15,600
No worries.

38
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,760
If you need anything else,

39
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:18,640
just let me know.

40
00:02:20,760 --> 00:02:21,040
(Chen Cong:
Pharmaceutical Businessman Peter)

41
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:26,360
(Profile of
Pharmaceutical Businessman Peter)

42
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:39,240
(Zhang Jinghang)

43
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:41,600
Hey, He Lan.

44
00:02:41,920 --> 00:02:42,960
Li Junsheng kidnapped Xiyu.

45
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:44,280
What?

46
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:45,360
I sent you the location.

47
00:02:45,440 --> 00:02:46,320
I'm heading there now.

48
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:48,960
You go home.

49
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:52,040
Li Junsheng is clearly after He Lan.

50
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:53,240
Luo Xiyu is He Lan's girlfriend.

51
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,040
Why are you getting involved?

52
00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:54,880
It's dangerous!

53
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:56,440
Every pair of hands helps.

54
00:02:56,440 --> 00:02:57,120
You head home.

55
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:58,520
I won't let you go!

56
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:01,240
Zhang Jinghang, you idiot!

57
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:28,360
Xiyu!

58
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:29,880
Xiyu!

59
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:07,440
Jinghang!

60
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:11,960
Perfect timing.

61
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:14,360
We can settle all our scores at once.

62
00:04:15,040 --> 00:04:16,120
Where did you hide Xiyu?

63
00:04:16,520 --> 00:04:17,320
Getting nervous?

64
00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:21,360
I love seeing you panic!

65
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:24,000
Jinghang,

66
00:04:24,520 --> 00:04:25,400
go find Xiyu, now.

67
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:26,200
We'll go together.

68
00:04:27,440 --> 00:04:28,360
Go!

69
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:47,040
Xiyu!

70
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:49,000
Xiyu!

71
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:38,240
Xiyu!

72
00:05:45,520 --> 00:05:46,640
Xiyu!

73
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:48,440
Xiyu!

74
00:05:51,080 --> 00:05:51,640
Xiyu!

75
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,160
Xiyu!

76
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:58,120
Xiyu!

77
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:14,560
I'm sorry.

78
00:06:14,960 --> 00:06:16,160
I'm sorry, I'm late.

79
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,400
You two have some nerve showing up.

80
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:39,160
Can't you deal with your own enemies?

81
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:40,840
You keep dragging Jinghang into this.

82
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:43,320
First his mother's memorial was trashed,

83
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:45,440
and now you've gotten him hurt
like this.

84
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:46,680
Do you even know

85
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:47,920
that three tendons

86
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:49,320
in his hand were severed?

87
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:51,080
He'll never be able to operate again!

88
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,320
I'm sorry.

89
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:55,840
What good is "sorry"?

90
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:58,080
Will saying sorry fix his hand?

91
00:06:58,480 --> 00:06:59,280
Shuqi,

92
00:07:00,200 --> 00:07:00,880
don't say that.

93
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:03,600
Li Junsheng is the one to blame.

94
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:07,640
If He Lan hadn't arrived in time,

95
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:10,640
I'd be in much worse shape.

96
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:12,600
Shuqi's right.

97
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,280
If it weren't for me,

98
00:07:14,280 --> 00:07:15,400
you wouldn't have gotten hurt.

99
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:17,600
You got dragged into this because of me.

100
00:07:18,440 --> 00:07:19,840
At least you know that.

101
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:21,880
Given what was happening,

102
00:07:22,200 --> 00:07:23,600
anyone would've stepped in.

103
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:24,520
By the way,

104
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:26,320
what did the police say

105
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,040
about Li Junsheng?

106
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:30,880
By the time the police arrived,

107
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:32,840
he wasn't breathing anymore.

108
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:36,160
Was it

109
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:38,200
those loan sharks?

110
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:40,480
We don't know yet.

111
00:07:46,640 --> 00:07:47,760
Why is your nose bleeding?

112
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,560
Maybe you should get it checked.

113
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:51,680
You don't need another injury.

114
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:54,760
I'm fine.

115
00:07:57,760 --> 00:07:58,720
I know my own body

116
00:07:58,760 --> 00:07:59,680
better than anyone.

117
00:08:00,880 --> 00:08:01,560
Jinghang,

118
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:03,640
we'll head home now.

119
00:08:04,280 --> 00:08:05,160
We'll come see you again.

120
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:07,640
Let us know if you want anything to eat.

121
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:19,600
Have some more.

122
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:25,640
Open your mouth.

123
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:30,000
(Last night,)

124
00:08:30,080 --> 00:08:31,120
(after fishermen alerted police,)

125
00:08:31,520 --> 00:08:32,080
(a stolen fishing boat)

126
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,640
(was discovered in the South China Sea.)

127
00:08:33,800 --> 00:08:34,560
(The vessel, Justice,)

128
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:37,120
(encountered a storm twenty nautical
miles from international waters)

129
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,360
(and unfortunately)

130
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:39,960
(capsized.)

131
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:42,800
(A passing vessel attempted a rescue.)

132
00:08:42,800 --> 00:08:43,440
(Stolen Fishing Boat "Justice"
Found in South China Sea)

133
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:45,040
(A 55-year-old man aboard)

134
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:46,200
(the Justice)

135
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:47,440
(was killed in the accident.)

136
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:49,800
(You asked me to track down
Li Junsheng.)

137
00:08:50,040 --> 00:08:51,200
(I found something.)

138
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:54,000
(Pharmaceutical Businessman Peter)
(Apparently, he's been looking into)

139
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:55,200
(a pharmaceutical businessman
who came back home from the U.S.)

140
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:05,000
Hey,

141
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:07,480
what did you have delivered to me?

142
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:10,000
To celebrate you becoming
principal dancer of the Dance Company,

143
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:11,560
and us getting a fresh start,

144
00:09:12,280 --> 00:09:14,040
and to celebrate
your 28th birthday early,

145
00:09:15,280 --> 00:09:16,880
I picked out a dress for you.

146
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:18,160
And I booked

147
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:19,400
a really romantic restaurant.

148
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,160
I'll send you the address.

149
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,040
See you there.

150
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:23,040
Okay.

151
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:23,720
Got it.

152
00:09:40,520 --> 00:09:42,360
(Today, I'll be wearing this dress)

153
00:09:42,800 --> 00:09:43,880
(when I'm murdered.)

154
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:50,840
Tell me,

155
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:52,720
if it isn't Wang Haotian

156
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:53,680
or Li Junsheng,

157
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:55,320
then who wants me dead?

158
00:09:58,280 --> 00:09:58,880
Fine.

159
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:00,360
You won't tell me, huh?

160
00:10:00,880 --> 00:10:02,600
I'm going to die today anyway.

161
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:04,600
I'll just go to the police station

162
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:05,880
and stay there till morning.

163
00:10:05,880 --> 00:10:07,920
Let's see who can kill me then.

164
00:10:09,280 --> 00:10:10,400
(You can dodge it once,)

165
00:10:10,760 --> 00:10:12,040
(but you can't dodge it forever.)

166
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:15,000
Then tell me who wants me dead exactly!

167
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:17,800
(The secrets of fate
cannot be revealed.)

168
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:19,800
(Karma cannot be interfered with.)

169
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:22,680
Fine.

170
00:10:23,800 --> 00:10:25,400
Then I'll just stay in the loop.
Whatever.

171
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:26,960
I've got all the time in the world,

172
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:28,080
and I've done this before.

173
00:10:28,880 --> 00:10:29,800
I don't care.

174
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,960
Let's see who can actually kill me.

175
00:10:32,920 --> 00:10:34,360
Besides, this doesn't cost me anything.

176
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:37,320
(All energy is conserved.)

177
00:10:37,680 --> 00:10:39,880
(Nothing can run forever
without a cost.)

178
00:10:43,640 --> 00:10:44,640
But I can recharge.

179
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:46,680
Wait.

180
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:47,880
Wait.

181
00:10:49,840 --> 00:10:51,400
He Lan's been getting nosebleeds lately.

182
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:52,920
No one knows why.

183
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:55,240
Is he being drained too?

184
00:10:56,280 --> 00:10:57,200
Is there any way

185
00:10:57,640 --> 00:10:58,920
for him to recharge too?

186
00:11:00,520 --> 00:11:01,480
(There isn't.)

187
00:11:04,160 --> 00:11:05,120
If this keeps happening,

188
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:07,320
what will happen to him?

189
00:11:07,920 --> 00:11:09,160
(He'll cease to exist.)

190
00:11:18,280 --> 00:11:19,400
That dress really suits you.

191
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:20,920
You look beautiful.

192
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:23,720
This designer's clothes
are so hard to get.

193
00:11:24,760 --> 00:11:26,560
How long did you have to wait for it?

194
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:28,120
Only three months.

195
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:29,840
As long as you like it,

196
00:11:30,560 --> 00:11:31,480
it's worth it.

197
00:11:34,040 --> 00:11:35,440
From the moment I first met you,

198
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:38,960
I already saw you in my future.

199
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,200
Even then,

200
00:11:42,280 --> 00:11:43,440
I knew our lives

201
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:44,880
would always be intertwined.

202
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:47,920
No matter how many times we start over,

203
00:11:48,880 --> 00:11:50,720
I'll always choose you
with absolute determination.

204
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:54,560
Now every obstacle is gone.

205
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,760
And every wish we made in the hospital

206
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:58,120
has come true.

207
00:11:59,560 --> 00:12:00,480
So I will...

208
00:12:01,760 --> 00:12:02,320
always,

209
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:03,840
always,

210
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:07,280
always love you.

211
00:12:14,880 --> 00:12:15,640
Happy birthday.

212
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,360
I accidentally got the dress...

213
00:12:30,160 --> 00:12:31,680
I got the dress dirty.

214
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:34,560
It's okay.

215
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:36,120
It's just a dress.

216
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:38,760
But today's so important,

217
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:40,720
and now I look like a mess.

218
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,720
I have a jacket in the car.

219
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:45,360
Could you get it for me?

220
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:52,920
Sure.

221
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:54,080
I'll get it.

222
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:54,640
Okay.

223
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:55,800
Wait here.

224
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:56,560
Okay.

225
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:12,280
(This time,)

226
00:13:12,920 --> 00:13:13,760
(I'm going to find out)

227
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:15,720
(who the killer really is.)

228
00:13:26,560 --> 00:13:27,440
(Zhang Jinghang?)

229
00:13:57,560 --> 00:13:58,360
Xiyu...

230
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:36,680
♪I hide my racing heart without a sound♪

231
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:43,240
♪I close my eyes and pretend
the story's been reset♪

232
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:47,360
♪I steer clear of every path
that leads to you♪

233
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:50,520
♪Trying to outrun the storm
we're destined for♪

234
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:53,440
♪I thought if I didn't hear, see,
or speak of you♪

235
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:56,920
♪I could cut every thread
that ties us together♪

236
00:14:58,080 --> 00:15:03,160
♪Through the endless night,
I guard my only secret♪

237
00:15:04,640 --> 00:15:09,720
♪In this new cycle, I watch you
become innocent again♪

238
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:13,000
♪I tried to erase the fire we once had♪

239
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:16,880
♪But I can't erase your name
carved into my bones♪

240
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:19,720
♪The more I try to leave you behind♪

241
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:23,840
♪The deeper I sink with no end in sight♪

242
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:26,720
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

243
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:30,120
♪Could I finally break free
from this cycle♪

244
00:15:30,520 --> 00:15:32,520
♪What if I took things a little slower♪

245
00:15:32,520 --> 00:15:36,520
♪Could I delay the moment
everything falls apart♪

246
00:15:36,760 --> 00:15:40,600
♪Maybe if I retreat to the edge
of my dreams♪

247
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:43,640
♪I could give you another future♪

248
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:50,080
♪A tomorrow where I no longer exist♪

249
00:15:50,080 --> 00:15:52,400
♪Even if I never want to see you again♪

250
00:15:52,400 --> 00:15:54,040
♪This nightmare still won't end♪

251
00:15:54,040 --> 00:15:55,800
♪Even if it all plays out again♪

252
00:15:55,800 --> 00:15:58,080
♪I'll still find my way back to you♪

253
00:15:58,080 --> 00:16:02,080
♪Even if having you only leaves me
in your debt♪

254
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:06,040
♪It's still better than
losing you forever♪
